 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, how does my",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 0.9,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "phone know it's me",
   "s": 0.96,
   "e": 1.76,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "and not my twin?",
   "s": 1.82,
   "e": 2.88,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "You have a twin?",
   "s": 2.94,
   "e": 4.07,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hypothetically.",
   "s": 4.38,
   "e": 5.18,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "It throws over thirty thousand",
   "s": 5.24,
   "e": 6.92,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "invisible dots at your face.",
   "s": 6.98,
   "e": 8.71,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Dots? Like a photo?",
   "s": 8.92,
   "e": 10.31,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "No. A camera watches how the",
   "s": 10.44,
   "e": 12.2,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "dots bend over your nose,",
   "s": 12.26,
   "e": 13.82,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "your cheeks,",
   "s": 13.88,
   "e": 14.52,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "your chin.",
   "s": 14.58,
   "e": 15.35,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So it draws a",
   "s": 15.48,
   "e": 16.18,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "map of my face.",
   "s": 16.24,
   "e": 17.43,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A map of its depth.",
   "s": 17.86,
   "e": 19.35,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hills and valleys.",
   "s": 19.48,
   "e": 20.83,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "The phone stored yours once,",
   "s": 21.24,
   "e": 22.52,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "and checks it every unlock.",
   "s": 22.58,
   "e": 24.65,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So a photo of",
   "s": 24.92,
   "e": 25.84,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "me wouldn't work?",
   "s": 25.9,
   "e": 26.91,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A photo is flat.",
   "s": 27.16,
   "e": 28.18,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "No hills,",
   "s": 28.24,
   "e": 29.67,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "no map.",
   "s": 29.82,
   "e": 30.63,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "What about a mask?",
   "s": 30.84,
   "e": 31.83,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A good one is",
   "s": 32.04,
   "e": 32.58,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "hard to make.",
   "s": 32.64,
   "e": 33.28,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And it wants your eyes open,",
   "s": 33.34,
   "e": 35.12,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "looking at it.",
   "s": 35.18,
   "e": 36.48,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And my twin?",
   "s": 36.54,
   "e": 37.33,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Same face,",
   "s": 37.52,
   "e": 38.43,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "same map.",
   "s": 38.52,
   "e": 39.33,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Strangers get in about one",
   "s": 39.58,
   "e": 40.94,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "time in a million.",
   "s": 41,
   "e": 42.21,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And twins?",
   "s": 42.62,
   "e": 43.29,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Identical ones can fool it.",
   "s": 43.72,
   "e": 45.33,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Apple says so itself.",
   "s": 45.46,
   "e": 46.77,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So hypothetically,",
   "s": 47.02,
   "e": 48.18,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "my twin reads my messages?",
   "s": 48.24,
   "e": 49.97,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hypothetically, get a better passcode.",
   "s": 50.74,
   "e": 52.7,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "And a better twin.",
   "s": 52.76,
